{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Knight's Helmet is a ",["l","帽子","hat"]," that can be obtained as a reward from ",["l","吉尔","Gil"]," at the ",["l","探险家公会","Adventurer's Guild"]," after completing the ",["l","探险家公会","Monster Eradication Goal"]," of killing 50 ",["l","霸王喷火龙","Pepper Rex"],"es. After that, it can be purchased from ",["l","马龙","Marlon"]," for 20,000g."]]]]]}